# ZenFocus Privacy Policy

ZenFocus is an offline-first focus and meditation application.

## Data Collection
ZenFocus does not collect, store, or share personal data by default.

## Optional Sign-In
If you choose to sign in using Apple or Google, ZenFocus uses your account
only to identify you for future features such as data synchronization.
Your focus data remains stored locally on your device unless explicit
sync is enabled in the future.

## Data Sharing
ZenFocus does not sell, rent, or share user data with third parties.
No analytics or tracking services are used.

## Offline Usage
All core features of ZenFocus work fully offline.

